# CI test selection, independent of reviewer ownership in CODEOWNERS.
# Format: <path pattern> [Tracer ASM CIVisibility Debugger Profiler]
# The last matching rule wins. A rule with no components clears earlier matches.
# Shared tracer changes and tracer/test/ are also handled in Build.VariableGenerations.cs.
# Keep patterns and ordering intact to preserve existing selection, including legacy glob behavior.

# Repository root files
/*

